iyvWEG\"><div class=\"Grid-styles__GridStyled-sc-70d90311-0 hGwupz\"><div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 fslKTl\"><div data-testid=\"dundee-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\" class=\"IndexCard-styles__IndexCardStyled-sc-3a0d8802-0 jeApUG\"><div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\"><a href=\"/news/articles/c1411pgje8xo\" data-testid=\"internal-link\" class=\"Anchor-styles__AnchorStyled-sc-651d33db-0 hygVWX\"><div data-testid=\"dundee-article\" class=\"Dundee-styles__CardStyled-sc-50abbc98-1 jHXbAb\"><div data-testid=\"card-image-wrapper\" class=\"Dundee-styles__ImageWrapperStyled-sc-50abbc98-3 ejTXUZ\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\" class=\"Dundee-styles__CardMediaStyled-sc-50abbc98-4 gZwtmn\"><div class=\"Image-styles__ImageCardStyled-sc-8c99a12b-1 erovmj\"><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260729-174851-148577b706-web-3.17.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" class=\"Image-styles__ImageStyled-sc-8c99a12b-0 kpUtIW hide-when-no-script\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"/><img sizes=\"25vw\" srcSet=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/2f78/live/bd896330-997f-11f1-a7ab-8b30adf0800a.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/2f78/live/bd896330-997f-11f1-a7ab-8b30adf0800a.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/2f78/live/bd896330-997f-11f1-a7ab-8b30adf0800a.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/2f78/live/bd896330-997f-11f1-a7ab-8b30adf0800a.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/2f78/live/bd896330-997f-11f1-a7ab-8b30adf0800a.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/2f78/live/bd896330-997f-11f1-a7ab-8b30adf0800a.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/2f78/live/bd896330-997f-11f1-a7ab-8b30adf0800a.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/2f78/live/bd896330-997f-11f1-a7ab-8b30adf0800a.jpg.webp\" loading=\"eager\" alt=\"A person stands next to a bicycle on a road near a burning Wildberries facility following a reported Ukrainian drone strike at the Koledino Industrial Park near Podolsk, Moscow Region\" class=\"Image-styles__ImageStyled-sc-8c99a12b-0 cVsHni\"/></div></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\" class=\"Grid-styles__GridStyled-sc-772acff9-0 kYsqtw\"><div class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__TitleGravityWrapper-sc-c7d910a6-1 dWFLGi\"><div class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__TitleWrapperStyled-sc-c7d910a6-0 hEhfIe\"><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\" class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__CardHeadlineStyled-sc-c7d910a6-3 dyeGOh\">Russia says at least seven killed in largest Ukrainian attack of 2026</h2></div></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\" class=\"Dundee-styles__DescriptionStyled-sc-50abbc98-0 eUixcX\">Moscow also launched deadly strikes against Ukraine overnight, sparking fires across the capital Kyiv.</p><div class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetadataStyled-sc-10966952-0 fIfKvi\"><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-lastupdated\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetaDataDateStyled-sc-10966952-1 feNzEJ\">2 hrs ago</span><div data-testid=\"card-metadata-separator\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__Separator-sc-10966952-3 decXPj\"></div><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetaDataTagStyled-sc-10966952-2 ewmvhB\">Europe</span></div></div></div></a></div></div></div><div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 igNVuU\"><div data-testid=\"manchester-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\" class=\"IndexCard-styles__IndexCardStyled-sc-3a0d8802-0 jeApUG\"><div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\"><a href=\"/sport/football/articles/c3300lxjz7lo\" data-testid=\"internal-link\" class=\"Anchor-styles__AnchorStyled-sc-651d33db-0 hygVWX\"><div data-testid=\"manchester-article\" class=\"Manchester-styles__CardStyled-sc-5c1d085b-1 cGPaOi\"><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\" class=\"Manchester-styles__TextWrapperStyled-sc-5c1d085b-2 eshOej\"><div class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__TitleGravityWrapper-sc-c7d910a6-1 dWFLGi\"><div class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__TitleWrapperStyled-sc-c7d910a6-0 hEhfIe\"><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\" class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__CardHeadlineStyled-sc-c7d910a6-3 dyeGOh\">&#x27;Probably my last year&#x27; - Ronaldo hints at retirement</h2></div></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\" class=\"Manchester-styles__DescriptionStyled-sc-5c1d085b-0 coxKqG\">Cristiano Ronaldo says this season will probably be his last as a player after a glittering football career.</p><div class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetadataStyled-sc-10966952-0 fIfKvi\"><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-lastupdated\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetaDataDateStyled-sc-10966952-1 feNzEJ\">4 hrs ago</span><div data-testid=\"card-metadata-separator\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__Separator-sc-10966952-3 decXPj\"></div><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetaDataTagStyled-sc-10966952-2 ewmvhB\">Football</span></div></div></div></a></div></div></div><div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 dHtWoZ\"><div data-testid=\"manchester-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\" class=\"IndexCard-styles__IndexCardStyled-sc-3a0d8802-0 jeApUG\"><div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\"><a href=\"/news/articles/c0l5583903yo\" data-testid=\"internal-link\" class=\"Anchor-styles__AnchorStyled-sc-651d33db-0 hygVWX\"><div data-testid=\"manchester-article\" class=\"Manchester-styles__CardStyled-sc-5c1d085b-1 cGPaOi\"><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\" class=\"Manchester-styles__TextWrapperStyled-sc-5c1d085b-2 eshOej\"><div class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__TitleGravityWrapper-sc-c7d910a6-1 dWFLGi\"><div class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__TitleWrapperStyled-sc-c7d910a6-0 hEhfIe\"><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\" class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__CardHeadlineStyled-sc-c7d910a6-3 dyeGOh\">Teen suspect in Virginia campus shooting found hiding in closet</h2></div></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\" class=\"Manchester-styles__DescriptionStyled-sc-5c1d085b-0 coxKqG\">The attack left five injured outside a halls of residence, and the suspect was not a student there, say police.</p><div class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetadataStyled-sc-10966952-0 fIfKvi\"><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-lastupdated\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetaDataDateStyled-sc-10966952-1 feNzEJ\">2 hrs ago</span><div data-testid=\"card-metadata-separator\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__Separator-sc-10966952-3 decXPj\"></div><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetaDataTagStyled-sc-10966952-2 ewmvhB\">US &amp; Canada</span></div></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 gwQYHw\"><div class=\"Grid-styles__GridStyled-sc-70d90311-0 dEVJyg\"><div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 jvrQiQ\"><div data-testid=\"dundee-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\" class=\"IndexCard-styles__IndexCardStyled-sc-3a0d8802-0 jeApUG\"><div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\"><a href=\"/news/articles/c87nnwlpe5no\" data-testid=\"internal-link\" class=\"Anchor-styles__AnchorStyled-sc-651d33db-0 hygVWX\"><div data-testid=\"dundee-article\" class=\"Dundee-styles__CardStyled-sc-50abbc98-1 jHXbAb\"><div data-testid=\"card-image-wrapper\" class=\"Dundee-styles__ImageWrapperStyled-sc-50abbc98-3 ejTXUZ\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\" class=\"Dundee-styles__CardMediaStyled-sc-50abbc98-4 gZwtmn\"><div class=\"Image-styles__ImageCardStyled-sc-8c99a12b-1 erovmj\"><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260729-174851-148577b706-web-3.17.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" class=\"Image-styles__ImageStyled-sc-8c99a12b-0 kpUtIW hide-when-no-script\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"/><img sizes=\"25vw\" srcSet=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/bbb6/live/70fefcb0-9992-11f1-a7ab-8b30adf0800a.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/bbb6/live/70fefcb0-9992-11f1-a7ab-8b30adf0800a.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/bbb6/live/70fefcb0-9992-11f1-a7ab-8b30adf0800a.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/bbb6/live/70fefcb0-9992-11f1-a7ab-8b30adf0800a.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/bbb6/live/70fefcb0-9992-11f1-a7ab-8b30adf0800a.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/bbb6/live/70fefcb0-9992-11f1-a7ab-8b30adf0800a.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/bbb6/live/70fefcb0-9992-11f1-a7ab-8b30adf0800a.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/bbb6/live/70fefcb0-9992-11f1-a7ab-8b30adf0800a.jpg.webp\" loading=\"eager\" alt=\"Firefighters work on a wildfire which prompted evacuations on the island of Salamina\" class=\"Image-styles__ImageStyled-sc-8c99a12b-0 cVsHni\"/></div></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\" class=\"Grid-styles__GridStyled-sc-772acff9-0 kYsqtw\"><div class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__TitleGravityWrapper-sc-c7d910a6-1 dWFLGi\"><div class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__TitleWrapperStyled-sc-c7d910a6-0 hEhfIe\"><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\" class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__CardHeadlineStyled-sc-c7d910a6-3 dyeGOh\">Two dead and hundreds evacuated after twin fires break out on Greek island</h2></div></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\" class=\"Dundee-styles__DescriptionStyled-sc-50abbc98-0 eUixcX\">About 200 firefighters worked to keep the fires from converging on Salamina, with one now under control.</p><div class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetadataStyled-sc-10966952-0 fIfKvi\"><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-lastupdated\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetaDataDateStyled-sc-10966952-1 feNzEJ\">53 mins ago</span><div data-testid=\"card-metadata-separator\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__Separator-sc-10966952-3 decXPj\"></div><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetaDataTagStyled-sc-10966952-2 ewmvhB\">Europe</span></div></div></div></a></div></div></div><div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 goLGVe\"><div data-testid=\"dundee-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\" class=\"IndexCard-styles__IndexCardStyled-sc-3a0d8802-0 jeApUG\"><div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\"><a href=\"/news/articles/ceqeeendz42o\" data-testid=\"internal-link\" class=\"Anchor-styles__AnchorStyled-sc-651d33db-0 hygVWX\"><div data-testid=\"dundee-article\" class=\"Dundee-styles__CardStyled-sc-50abbc98-1 jHXbAb\"><div data-testid=\"card-image-wrapper\" class=\"Dundee-styles__ImageWrapperStyled-sc-50abbc98-3 ejTXUZ\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\" class=\"Dundee-styles__CardMediaStyled-sc-50abbc98-4 gZwtmn\"><div class=\"Image-styles__ImageCardStyled-sc-8c99a12b-1 erovmj\"><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260729-174851-148577b706-web-3.17.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" class=\"Image-styles__ImageStyled-sc-8c99a12b-0 kpUtIW hide-when-no-script\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"/><img sizes=\"25vw\" srcSet=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/cfe2/live/6ee53b10-99ab-11f1-870d-5d08c49babb2.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/cfe2/live/6ee53b10-99ab-11f1-870d-5d08c49babb2.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/cfe2/live/6ee53b10-99ab-11f1-870d-5d08c49babb2.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/cfe2/live/6ee53b10-99ab-11f1-870d-5d08c49babb2.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/cfe2/live/6ee53b10-99ab-11f1-870d-5d08c49babb2.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/cfe2/live/6ee53b10-99ab-11f1-870d-5d08c49babb2.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/cfe2/live/6ee53b10-99ab-11f1-870d-5d08c49babb2.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/cfe2/live/6ee53b10-99ab-11f1-870d-5d08c49babb2.jpg.webp\" loading=\"eager\" alt=\" The US Navy Nimitz-class aircraft carrier USS Abraham Lincoln \" class=\"Image-styles__ImageStyled-sc-8c99a12b-0 cVsHni\"/></div></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\" class=\"Grid-styles__GridStyled-sc-772acff9-0 kYsqtw\"><div class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__TitleGravityWrapper-sc-c7d910a6-1 dWFLGi\"><div class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__TitleWrapperStyled-sc-c7d910a6-0 hEhfIe\"><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\" class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__CardHeadlineStyled-sc-c7d910a6-3 dyeGOh\">US commander says mental health a &#x27;priority&#x27; on USS Lincoln</h2></div></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\" class=\"Dundee-styles__DescriptionStyled-sc-50abbc98-0 eUixcX\">Adm Brad Cooper acknowledged that navy service at sea for long periods is &quot;uniquely challenging and tough&quot;, following a visit to the warship.</p><div class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetadataStyled-sc-10966952-0 fIfKvi\"><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-lastupdated\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetaDataDateStyled-sc-10966952-1 feNzEJ\">29 mins ago</span><div data-testid=\"card-metadata-separator\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__Separator-sc-10966952-3 decXPj\"></div><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetaDataTagStyled-sc-10966952-2 ewmvhB\">US &amp; Canada</span></div></div></div></a></div></div></div><div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 gxFJdW\"><div data-testid=\"dundee-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\" class=\"IndexCard-styles__IndexCardStyled-sc-3a0d8802-0 jeApUG\"><div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\"><a href=\"/news/articles/cqjxx2gzd9qo\" data-testid=\"internal-link\" class=\"Anchor-styles__AnchorStyled-sc-651d33db-0 hygVWX\"><div data-testid=\"dundee-article\" class=\"Dundee-styles__CardStyled-sc-50abbc98-1 jHXbAb\"><div data-testid=\"card-image-wrapper\" class=\"Dundee-styles__ImageWrapperStyled-sc-50abbc98-3 ejTXUZ\"><div data-testid=\"card-media\" class=\"Dundee-styles__CardMediaStyled-sc-50abbc98-4 gZwtmn\"><div class=\"Image-styles__ImageCardStyled-sc-8c99a12b-1 erovmj\"><img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260729-174851-148577b706-web-3.17.0-2/grey-placeholder.png\" class=\"Image-styles__ImageStyled-sc-8c99a12b-0 kpUtIW hide-when-no-script\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"/><img sizes=\"25vw\" srcSet=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/240/cpsprodpb/ad24/live/d18d0100-996d-11f1-aaab-c702cc6b4645.jpg.webp 240w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/320/cpsprodpb/ad24/live/d18d0100-996d-11f1-aaab-c702cc6b4645.jpg.webp 320w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/ad24/live/d18d0100-996d-11f1-aaab-c702cc6b4645.jpg.webp 480w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/640/cpsprodpb/ad24/live/d18d0100-996d-11f1-aaab-c702cc6b4645.jpg.webp 640w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/800/cpsprodpb/ad24/live/d18d0100-996d-11f1-aaab-c702cc6b4645.jpg.webp 800w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1024/cpsprodpb/ad24/live/d18d0100-996d-11f1-aaab-c702cc6b4645.jpg.webp 1024w,https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/1536/cpsprodpb/ad24/live/d18d0100-996d-11f1-aaab-c702cc6b4645.jpg.webp 1536w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/ad24/live/d18d0100-996d-11f1-aaab-c702cc6b4645.jpg.webp\" loading=\"eager\" alt=\"Three surviving panels of Antonello da Messina&#x27;s San Gregorio Polyptych, showing the Virgin Mary and Christ, St Gregory and St Benedict\" class=\"Image-styles__ImageStyled-sc-8c99a12b-0 cVsHni\"/></div></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\" class=\"Grid-styles__GridStyled-sc-772acff9-0 kYsqtw\"><div class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__TitleGravityWrapper-sc-c7d910a6-1 dWFLGi\"><div class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__TitleWrapperStyled-sc-c7d910a6-0 hEhfIe\"><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\" class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__CardHeadlineStyled-sc-c7d910a6-3 dyeGOh\">Four &#x27;extraordinary&#x27; Renaissance paintings stolen from Italian museum</h2></div></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\" class=\"Dundee-styles__DescriptionStyled-sc-50abbc98-0 eUixcX\">The works were taken overnight without alarms being triggered, raising suspicion of a professional hit.</p><div class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetadataStyled-sc-10966952-0 fIfKvi\"